<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil nets 45 mln reais in Aug.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil nets 45 mln reais in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government bank Banco do Brasil said it had a net profit of 45.170 million reais, or 0.06 real per lot of 1,000 shares, for the month of August.</p>
<p>In the July-August period, the bank's net profit was 74.948 million reais, it said.</p>
<p>In the first half, Banco do Brasil posted the country's largest ever commercial loss, 7.8 billion reais, after posting a 4.2 billion reais loss in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
